  "summary_en": "ILO policy brief on how LLMs like ChatGPT affect knowledge work, arguing task transformation is likelier than mass job loss. It highlights job quality, digital divides, precarious data-labelling work, and calls for social dialogue and occupational safety regulation to manage transitions.",
